@startuml

participant MetadataService as client
participant JNI as jni
participant GnService as gnservice
participant GnRequestCoverart as request
participant GNSDK as gnsdk
participant GracenoteBackend as backend

activate client
client -> jni: doTextLookupForAlbum

activate jni
jni -> gnservice: requestCoverArtFromMetadata

activate gnservice
gnservice -> request: create request

activate request
request -> gnsdk: query album

activate gnsdk
gnsdk -> backend: query album

backend --> gnsdk: result album
gnsdk --> request: result album
request -> gnsdk: query metadata
gnsdk --> request: result metadata
request -> gnsdk: query image uri
gnsdk --> request: result image uri
request -> gnsdk: query image data
gnsdk -> backend: query image data
backend --> gnsdk: result image data
gnsdk --> request: result image data
deactivate gnsdk

request --> gnservice: result metadata & image
deactivate request

gnservice --> client: result metadata & image
deactivate gnservice

deactivate jni
deactivate client

@enduml
